Z||000000||fierobaby||06-18-2001||11:48 AM||||ok my hood release cable is broken and the only way to close the hood is to fiddle (yes fiddle!) with the cable...do you have any tips on how to fix that? or do I need to just buy an entirly new one (which I don't want to do)<P>------------------<BR>1984 Sweet Candy Apple red Fiero sport coupe :-D||||reg||5
Z||000001||rogergarrison||06-18-2001||12:40 PM||||there are 2 cables in the one cable system. one goes to the handle/latch, the other is just a cable with a nub on the end held up with a clip close to the latch. pull it with fingers or pliers. You have to replace the cable as an assembly, ez and only costs about $8.00 new. seems like the main cable is probably kinked or binding in the housing.||||reg||1
